# Simulator flow_config override backups (crash-recovery; auto-cleared on next run)
apps/api/.simulator-backups/

# Alta Men product photos (266 files / 28 MB) scraped from altamen.com.ua for
# the demo-altamen tenant. Deliberately NOT committed — third-party imagery,
# and the rest of test-assets/ (root fixtures + cosmetics/) stays tracked.
#
# Consequence: `seed:demo:altamen` cannot reproduce them from a clean checkout.
# `copyImages` logs `! image source missing: …` per file and the seed still
# completes, but every product renders imageless. The files live in two places:
#   - prod box: /opt/directmate-assets/altamen  (outside the deploy rsync path,
#     and already copied into the `uploads` docker volume)
#   - whoever ran the scrape (apps/api/src/scripts/seed/data/altamen/README.md
#     documents how they were produced)
# Restore with: rsync -az root@<prod>:/opt/directmate-assets/altamen/ \
#                 apps/api/test-assets/altamen/
apps/api/test-assets/altamen/
